Description: Mainuan control panel for KDE Plasma
 Mainuan Painel de Controle automatically detects whether it is running on a
 desktop computer or a notebook, displays the matching device map and a
 summary of the detected hardware, and opens the related KDE Plasma settings
 modules through kcmshell6. "Advanced Mode" opens complete System Settings.
 .
 The interface follows the language of the Plasma session.
